%!PS
% SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 EfterScript contributors
% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% Scenario: nesting deeper than the limit is a limitcheck at scan time.
% Expect: prints "/limitcheck".
/deep 1001 string 0 1 1000 { deep exch 123 put } for def   % 1001 "{" bytes
/close 1001 string 0 1 1000 { close exch 125 put } for def % 1001 "}" bytes
{ deep close 2 { cvx exec } repeat } stopped pop
$error /errorname get ==
